# Citation metadata for pripipe.
# Fill in the preferred-citation block once a paper or preprint exists;
# until then GitHub can still use the software entry below.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pripipe in your research, please cite this software."

title: "pripipe: plant pri-miRNA annotation from Iso-Seq and RNA-Seq"
abstract: >-
  pripipe annotates plant pri-miRNA transcripts from Iso-Seq and/or RNA-Seq data.
  For every pre-miRNA in a supplied BED file it reports which assembled transcripts
  contain the hairpin, how those transcripts are structured (spliced or intronic),
  processing intermediates observed at the locus, and, when RNA-Seq is available,
  locus-level expression.

type: software

